WEBVTT

1.1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.631
Step 1. Open the referral page. You can change the title or the note of a referral.

2.1
00:00:06.631 --> 00:00:12.208
Step 2. Select the three-dot button at the right end of the patient's name bar,

2.2
00:00:12.208 --> 00:00:18.373
then Edit referral, the first item of the menu. Care opens the Edit referral dialog.

3.1
00:00:18.373 --> 00:00:23.565
Step 3. Change the Referral title or the Note. The title is required.

3.2
00:00:23.565 --> 00:00:28.863
The referral page shows the note under Reason and clinical context.

4.1
00:00:28.863 --> 00:00:33.665
Step 4. Select Save Changes at the bottom right of the dialog.

4.2
00:00:33.665 --> 00:00:39.450
Care saves only the fields that you changed, and shows Referral updated.
